<title>USA: Draxis Health names Garner CFO.</title>
<headline>Draxis Health names Garner CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ontario-based Draxis Health Inc said on Monday that it named Jim A.H. Garner as vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Prior to his appointment, Garner was director of corporate finance at Algoma Steel Inc.</p>
<p>Garner succeeds A. Cameron Strong, the company's controller who was serving as interim chief financial officer since April 1996, a company spokesman said. Strong replaced Edward Foster in that post, the spokesman said.</p>
